rooms_desc ({"You are in a huge room. There is a beautiful fountain in the center of theroom. To the north you see a red portal leading to somewhere unknown. You hearthe sound of a T.V. to the west. You see a BIG sign on the east wall!Perhaps you should look at it?","As you enter the room you can almost see the magic in this room. Hanging fromthe ceiling is a strange blue globe of light. On the west wall is a bigworktable. There seem to be several experiments in progress. To the southis a normal door leading back into the house. Guarding the door is a giant.There is a small imp adjusting some of the tubes and dials on the worktable.","In here you see a big screen T.V. and a very expensive stereo system.The stereo and T.V. are so loud you can't even hear your self think.You notice a bar located on the west wall. and you see that Darnyte hasmarked the north wall with the outline of a door. You wonder what will gothere.","This is Darnyte's transport nexus, it has exits leading to the shop, thechurch, the main guild in town, and of course back into the house..:)You can feel the room throb with power, and feel awe knowing what greatmagiks have been wroght here to produce this room.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,})
