items ({({"fountain","A beautiful blue fountain","sign","Welcome to my house.. enjoy yourself",}),({"magic","This room positivly reeks of magic","light","It is a blue globe of light, magic in nature, it lights up the whole room","worktable","It is a big worktable made of oak, there is a mess of tubes and dials","door","It looks pretty normal","giant","he's huge, you don't think it'd be wise to attack him","imp","Though he looks small he doesn't look like one to mess with",}),({"tv","It's showing OLD star trek episodes... you want to barf!","T.V.","It's showing old star trek episodes... you want to barf!","stereo","It's set to 107.7 The End. You start headbanging! :>",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
